# ============================================================
# Power BI
# ============================================================
# Never commit the binary workbook — this repo uses the PBIP (text) format.
*.pbix
# Local caches and per-user settings generated by Power BI Desktop
*.pbip.cache/
.pbi/
**/.pbi/
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/*.SemanticModel/.pbi/
**/*.Report/.pbi/

# ============================================================
# SQL
# ============================================================
# The built SQLite database (sql/makemytrip.db) IS tracked on purpose — it's a
# deliverable, and load_data.py rebuilds it. SQLite's transient side files are not:
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
# If you would rather NOT track the database and have people rebuild it, uncomment:
# sql/makemytrip.db

